    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112034" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φολλικώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
		dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
			Hp.
			<u>Epid.</u>
			4.30
		</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φολιδώδης</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>full of cavities, spongy,</i>
			acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.153
			</span></i>; <i>scabby,</i> acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>, who has <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόλλιξ</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ικος</span>, ἡ, in
			sense of a <i>scab, leprous sore.</i></div>
